      "content": "\n\n# Most football (soccer) Ligue 1 titles won by a player\n![Most football \\(soccer\\) Ligue 1 titles won by a player](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/images/css/gwr-ph.jpg)\n**Share**\n  * **Facebook**\n  * **Twitter**\n  * **Email**\n  * **Whatsapp**\n  * **Pinterest**\n  * **LinkedIn**\n  * **Reddit**\n\n[ Contact an Account Manager ](https://journey.guinnessworldrecords.com/contact/s/?language=en_GB) Who\n    Marquinhos What\n     11 total number  Where\n     France  When\n     13 May 2026 \nThe most football (soccer) Ligue 1 titles won by a player is 11, achieved by Marquinhos (Brazil, b. Marcos Aoás Corrêa) playing for Paris Saint-Germain in 2014–16, 2018–20 and 2022–26.\nCentre-back Marquinhos claimed a record-extending 11th Ligue 1 title in 2025/26, in only his 13th season at Paris Saint-Germain.\nRecords change on a daily basis and are not immediately published online. For a full list of record titles, please use our Record Application Search. (You will need to register / login for access)\nComments below may relate to previous holders of this record.\n15-701826 \n### Related Articles\n### Related Records\n![Officially Amazing - Guinness World Records.](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/images/footer-strapline.png)\n##### USING THIS SITE\n  * [Terms & Conditions](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/using-this-website/terms-and-conditions/index.html)\n  * [Cookie Policy](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/using-this-website/cookie-policy.html)\n  * [Privacy Policy](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/using-this-website/privacy-policy.html)\n  * [Consultant login](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/account/consultant/login)\n\n\n##### CONTACT US\n  * [Get in touch](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/contact/index.html)\n  * [GWR for Business: Contact an Account Manager](https://journey.guinnessworldrecords.com/contact/s/?language=en_GB)\n  * [Press Centre](https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/news/press/index.html)\n\n\n  * [ **Facebook** ](http://www.facebook.com/GuinnessWorldRecords)\n  * [ **Twitter** ](https://twitter.com/GWR)\n  * [ **LinkedIn** ](https://www.linkedin.com/company/guinness-world-records)\n  * [ **YouTube** ](http://www.youtube.com/user/GuinnessWorldRecords)\n  * [ **Instagram** ](https://instagram.com/guinnessworldrecords/)\n  * [ **Tiktok** ](https://www.tiktok.com/@guinnessworldrecords)\n  * [ **WhatsApp** ](https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va2exMN6RGJ",
